# REST API — UPDATE Account
# cURL Command and Output

## Command:
$ curl -X PUT http://localhost:8080/accounts/1 \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "name": "Dhananjay Kumar (Updated)",
    "email": "dhananjay.updated@example.com",
    "address": "456 New Address, Hyderabad, India",
    "phone_number": "+91-9876543210"
  }'

## Output:
{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Dhananjay Kumar (Updated)",
  "email": "dhananjay.updated@example.com",
  "address": "456 New Address, Hyderabad, India",
  "phone_number": "+91-9876543210",
  "date_joined": "2026-04-24"
}

## HTTP Response:
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json

## Status: SUCCESS — Account with ID 1 updated successfully
